{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J44Zxm2T3iGqUH6NcE62jP","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Desk reference\n2\t\n3\t## Reading history\n4\t\n5\tRevisions are listed newest first within a post. Draft saves update the post\n6\twithout adding a snapshot.\n7\t\n8\t## Missed build\n9\t\n10\tA failed hook undoes the publish. The author should publish the post again.\n11\t\n12\tOpen the site's hosting dashboard and check its queue for this publication.\n13\tIf a build for it is queued or running, stop and follow that build. Otherwise\n14\ttrigger one rebuild from the host dashboard. Publishing again creates another\n15\trevision.\n16\t\n17\tThe [receipt from Acme's release](../receipts/hook-17.txt) is the record used\n18\twhen support reviews that release.\n19\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9c6b8195-6831-4a69-8441-b74ebe8863d9","uuid":"f25adc8a-0dac-4ec4-a7fd-863528b5b9d1","timestamp":"2026-11-28T05:11:55.548Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/skill-evaluation-0NIi1k/docs/guides/desk.md","content":"# Desk reference\n\n## Reading history\n\nRevisions are listed newest first within a post. Draft saves update the post\nwithout adding a snapshot.\n\n## Missed build\n\nA failed hook undoes the publish. The author should publish the post again.\n\nOpen the site's hosting dashboard and check its queue for this publication.\nIf a build for it is queued or running, stop and follow that build. Otherwise\ntrigger one rebuild from the host dashboard. Publishing again creates another\nrevision.\n\nThe [receipt from Acme's release](../receipts/hook-17.txt) is the record used\nwhen support reviews that release.\n","numLines":19,"startLine":1,"totalLines":19}}}
